  "title": "The Hidden Treasure of the Black Shores",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The Hidden Treasure of the Black Shores</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Side Quests\">Side</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">After following the <a href=\"/wiki/Data_Logs_of_the_Black_Shores_Employee_Forum\" title=\"Data Logs of the Black Shores Employee Forum\">clues</a>, you discover the room said to conceal hidden treasures. Yet, it appears to be just an ordinary room...</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Camellya\" title=\"Camellya\">Camellya</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Hoda\" title=\"Hoda\">Hoda</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<b>The Hidden Treasure of the Black Shores</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quest\" title=\"Side Quest\">Side Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Shores_Archipelago\" title=\"Black Shores Archipelago\">Black Shores Archipelago</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Black_Shores\" title=\"The Black Shores\">The Black Shores</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Guides\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Guides</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Investigate the mysterious room</li>\n<li>Leave the \"Coastal Room\"</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>To unlock this quest, the player needs to interact multiple times with Black Shores Archipelago doors in a set order. You can see the order in <a href=\"#Video_Guides\">this video guide</a></li>\n<li>Completing the step \"Investigate the mysterious room\" and claiming the chest in the room awards the player the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Footprints_of_the_Shores_I\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Footprints of the Shores I\">Footprints of the Shores I</a></i> trophy <i><a href=\"/wiki/Old_Family_Squab_Recipe\" title=\"Old Family Squab Recipe\">Old Family Squab Recipe</a></i>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">After following the clues, you discover the room said to conceal hidden treasures. Yet, it appears to be just an ordinary room...</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Investigate)</dt>\n<dd><i>On the desk, the terminal's screen is still lit.</i></dd>\n<dd><i>You look at the information displayed—seems to be a voice-to-text memo.</i></dd>\n<dd><i>It appears to be a record of conversation that once took place here. Unfortunately, the original audio file is corrupted.</i></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><big><b>Audio Transcription</b></big><hr />[00:01] (Knocking sound)<br />[00:04] Come in.<br />[00:09] Hello, I'm from the Engineering Department. Is this—Oh, Ms. <a href=\"/wiki/Hoda\" title=\"Hoda\">Hoda</a>! Ouch—<br />[00:19] (Sound of collision)<br />[00:20] Oh no, are you okay? Sorry, it's a bit of a mess in here.<br />[00:24] No worries, I'm fine. Just stubbed my toe.<br />[00:30] ...That sounds painful.<br />[00:32] Yeah, it's one of those pains that really hits you when it happens.<br />[00:34] Hahaha! You've got a good sense of humor, haven't you? Wait, what's that look?<br />[00:47] Oh, nothing. I'm just surprised. I didn't expect to see you smile like that.<br />[01:00] Do I come across as stiff to everyone?<br />[01:03] Well, not exactly... But you're always so focused at work, so... Oh, by the way, I heard you're managing this room now. This is the demolition approval form. Could you please sign here? The room's set to be demolished next month to make way for a new office area.<br />[01:36] (A brief silence)<br />[01:47] Ms. Hoda?<br />[01:50] I've signed it, but no one's really managing this room anymore, so you don't need to follow the formal process.<br />[01:58] Well, I heard some of our old employees like to nap here. Just wanted to double-check before construction begins. I didn't expect to find you here... You seem quite familiar with this place?<br />[02:16] Familiar? I don't know if that's the right word. How long have you been with the Black Shores?<br />[02:23] One year and three months.<br />[02:26] Really? Time flies... So, you must have met the <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Mentor</a> by now?<br />[02:32] Your mentor? You mean the Modulator? Yes, but I've only seen them from a distance. I haven't really had a chance to talk. Big shots like the Modulator and <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shorekeeper\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Shorekeeper\">the Shorekeeper</a> are always busy.<br />[02:44] Big shot? You mean my mentor? Ha, sometimes I wonder if things would've been easier for us if they were just a regular member... I actually first ran into them right here. You wanna know the first thing they said to me?<br />[03:01] Really? Umm, I have no idea...<br />[03:06] They asked if I wanted some crispy squab for dinner.<br />[03:11] What?<br />[03:14] Unbelievable, right? It was my first day on the job. Everyone was busy, and I was sitting here, staring at the employee handbook. Almost thought they were one of our cooks.<br />[03:39] So, what happened after that?<br />[03:44] Then Lady <a href=\"/wiki/Camellya\" title=\"Camellya\">Flora</a>, you know, our Mentor's little tail, actually brought some crispy squab over for me. The three of us sat here, ate squab, drank soda, and played cards all night. By the time we said goodbye, I realized all my first-day nerves were gone.<br />[04:20] It wasn't until the next day, during my formal orientation, that I found out they were the Modulator everyone talked about.<br />[04:29] Whoa... That's so cool... I wish it was me...<br />[04:34] I can still vividly picture Mentor with those paper slips stuck to their forehead—<span>(&#8205;&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"his\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">his</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for male Rover</span></span>&#8205;/<wbr />&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"her\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">her</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for female Rover</span></span>&#8205;&#8205;)</span> punishment for losing our card game. I remember the vibrant colors of Lady Flora's flowers, the winning hand I had, and the smell of crispy squab. It all happened right here, in this very room.<br />[04:47] And it was just an ordinary day in the Black Shores's most ordinary room.<br />[04:53] ...So, erm, how was the squab?<br />[04:56] Not good. The cook forgot to add seasoning.<br />[05:00] (End of recording)</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Rover:</b> ...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Claim the chest)</dt>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Is this thing still edible?</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Guides\">Video Guides</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"thumb embedvideo autoResize\" style=\"width: 408px;\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo autoResize\" style=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideowrap\" style=\"width: 400px;\">\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t<iframe title=\"Play video\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/WLCC72h0Mos?\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\" style=\"border: none;\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>\n</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"thumbcaption\">Guide: The Hidden Treasure of the Black Shores</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\